- id: TF-62AC76B728
  title: Container runs as root
  category: Elevation of Privilege
  element: k8s:Container:shop/postgres/postgres
  severity: critical
  description: Container shop/postgres has no runAsNonRoot/runAsUser constraint, so it runs as UID 0 inside
    the container. Root in the container means write access to every file in the image, the ability to
    install tooling at runtime, and a materially easier escape if a kernel or runtime vulnerability is
    available.
  evidence:
  - description: runAsUser is unset or 0
    observed: null
    location: k8s/app.yaml:115
  - description: runAsNonRoot is not true
    observed: null
    location: k8s/app.yaml:115
  risk:
    score: 20
    likelihood: 4
    impact: 5
    exposure_hops: 3
  references:
