- id: TF-19F57BE180
  title: ClusterRole grants full cluster administration
  category: Elevation of Privilege
  element: k8s:ClusterRole:default/shop-operator
  severity: critical
  description: 'ClusterRole shop-operator grants `*` verbs on `*` resources cluster-wide. Any subject
