    effort: high
- id: TF-FE6A82C1BB
  title: Compose service publishes a port on all interfaces
  category: Spoofing
  element: compose:service:api
  severity: high
  description: ComposeService api publishes 8080:8080 without binding to a specific host IP, so the port
    is reachable on every interface -- including the public one on a cloud VM. Docker also writes iptables
    rules directly, which commonly bypasses host firewall configuration such as ufw.
