    effort: medium
- id: TF-8806B0358F
  title: Hardcoded credential in Terraform source
  category: Information Disclosure
  element: tf:aws_db_instance.shop
  severity: high
  description: aws_db_instance shop has a credential-shaped attribute with a literal value. Terraform
    source is version-controlled, and any value here is also written in cleartext into the state file,
