    observed: null
    location: k8s/app.yaml:99
  risk:
    score: 12
    likelihood: 3
    impact: 4
    exposure_hops: 2
  references:
    cwe:
    - CWE-693
    mitre:
    - T1611
    cis:
    - 5.7.2
    nist:
    - SI-16
    - CM-7
  rule_id: TF-K8S-014
  mitigation:
    status: open
    description: Apply the RuntimeDefault seccomp profile.
    effort: low
- id: TF-EB27941387
  title: Workload has no egress NetworkPolicy
  category: Information Disclosure
  element: k8s:StatefulSet:shop/postgres
  severity: high
  description: 'StatefulSet shop/postgres has unrestricted egress. That is the exfiltration path and the
    command-and-control path: a compromised pod can reach any external host, any internal service, and
    the cloud metadata endpoint at 169.254.169.254 to steal node IAM credentials.'
  evidence:
  - description: no NetworkPolicy restricts egress
    observed: false
    location: k8s/app.yaml:99
  risk:
    score: 12
    likelihood: 3
    impact: 4
    exposure_hops: 2
  references:
    cwe:
    - CWE-1327
    mitre:
    - T1041
    - T1552.005
    cis:
    - 5.3.2
    nist:
    - SC-7
    - AC-4
    owasp:
    - K05
  rule_id: TF-NET-002
  mitigation:
    status: open
    description: Default-deny egress; allow DNS plus the specific destinations required.
    effort: medium
- id: TF-406F7EE57C
  title: Internet-facing Ingress has no authentication or rate limiting
  category: Spoofing
  element: k8s:Ingress:shop/storefront-ingress
  severity: high
  description: Ingress shop/storefront-ingress is exposed to the internet with no ingress-level authentication
    and no rate limit. Whether that is acceptable depends on whether the backend authenticates -- but
    the absence of a rate limit is unconditionally a denial of service and credential-stuffing exposure.
  evidence:
  - description: no auth-* annotations
    observed: false
    location: k8s/app.yaml:63
  - description: no rate-limit annotations
    observed: false
    location: k8s/app.yaml:63
  risk:
    score: 12
    likelihood: 4
    impact: 3
    exposure_hops: 1
  references:
    cwe:
    - CWE-307
    - CWE-770
    mitre:
    - T1110
    - T1499
    nist:
    - SC-5
    - IA-2
    owasp:
    - K07
  rule_id: TF-NET-005
  mitigation:
    status: open
    description: Add rate limiting at the ingress; add edge authentication for non-public endpoints.
    effort: low
- id: TF-71337D0457
  title: Ingress uses a wildcard host
  category: Spoofing
  element: k8s:Ingress:shop/storefront-ingress
  severity: high
  description: A wildcard host binds this backend to every subdomain, which enables subdomain takeover
    chains and makes cookie scoping decisions unsafe -- a cookie set on *.example.com is readable by every
    other service under it.
  evidence:
  - description: hosts = *.shop.example.com
    observed:
    - '*.shop.example.com'
    location: k8s/app.yaml:63
  risk:
    score: 12
    likelihood: 4
    impact: 3
    exposure_hops: 1
  references:
