- id: TF-A03BACF399
  title: Workload uses the default service account
  category: Elevation of Privilege
  element: k8s:Deployment:shop/storefront
  severity: medium
  description: Deployment shop/storefront runs as the namespace `default` service account with its token
    automounted. The default SA is shared by every workload in the namespace, so any permission granted
    to it is granted to all of them, and token theft cannot be attributed to a specific workload.
  evidence:
  - description: serviceAccountName is 'default'
    observed: default
    location: k8s/app.yaml:7
  - description: automountServiceAccountToken is not disabled
    observed: null
    location: k8s/app.yaml:7
