- id: TF-6A7C7B9BFC
  title: Single-replica workload is a single point of failure
  category: Denial of Service
  element: k8s:Deployment:shop/storefront
  severity: low
  description: Deployment shop/storefront is internet-reachable but runs a single replica, so any crash,
